    "source": "hand-drafted from IR inspection of MNO-C sample (strand mno-c-ingestion)",
    "notes": "All proprietary tokens are placeholders per D-062. <PREFIX> = common req-id prefix; <PREFIX1>/<PREFIX2>/<PREFIX3> = the req-id TYPE tags (non-requirement text / structural sub-section / actual requirement). Real values live ONLY in customizations/mappings/bs_cf29e619.json (work-PC, pushed to company-internal git, never the public mirror). The req-id pattern is scoped to <PREFIX3> so ONLY actual-requirement headings become Requirements; <PREFIX1>/<PREFIX2> headings stay structural. <PRIORITY1>..<PRIORITY5> = the 5 requirement-severity type names (e.g. one is the 'Mandatory' marker) — map each to one value; the alternation `|`s live in the pattern, not the mapped values (specific placeholders are re.escape'd). DRAFT — several fields (font levels/body_text, exclude pattern, plan extraction) need validation against the full IR on the work PC."
  },
